// One slot of an entity's record, or zero when there is no entity.
//
// The scene's own script runs with e = -1, and -1 is not an index: a record read
// at minus one is an out-of-range store access, which aborts the process. Every
// place that reads a record on behalf of a script goes through here.

scr_eb(int e, int k) {
  int v = 0;
  if (e >= 0) { v = ent_at(e, k); }
} return int v;
given idem_init (-1, 0):(0)
given scr_fixture (1, 4):(1000)
